      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哦……！　/n卡米拉前辈，你真的看了呀？　",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯！　光看动画的时候只觉得是部老作品，/n结果一看原作，印象直接全被颠覆了！　",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030030",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "对吧！　真的就是浓缩成块的情绪啊！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "资深团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "原作里动画淡化掉的那些人物关系，可是描写得特别浓厚呢。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "太懂了！　看完以后再从头重读，/n会发现表情和动作的描写特别厉害！　全都串起来了！　",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哇，我看的时候可能根本没注意到那么细。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你要是感兴趣，我能一直讲下去哦！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那等晚上有空的时候，开语音边聊边说吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030090",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "话说回来，你明明比我还小，怎么会知道这么老的作品啊？　",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030091",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "因为我最喜欢爷爷了！　/n每次暑假回乡下，他都会拿给我看！　",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "资深团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "到我们这一代，当年前辈还会说这可是“基础教养”呢。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "基础教养……电姬的大家，也太强了吧……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "诶——。要我说，反而是卡米拉前辈更厉害吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哈？　为啥？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "因为你明明是辣妹，/n却愿意对我们喜欢的东西这么感兴趣啊！　",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我也对化妆感兴趣，也想COS辣妹系角色，/n但卡米拉前辈本来就跟我们不是一种类型嘛。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不不不，辣妹又不是什么特殊生物。/n化妆啊穿搭啊，我想教多少都行。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030170",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 12,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不是这个意思啦～。/n对我们这种阴角来说，那就是没法踏进去的领域……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可卡米拉前辈不一样，是阳角和阴角这两种本来不会相交的存在合而为一！　/n怎么说呢，就是一种憧憬，或者说最强？　Goddess？　",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这也太难懂了吧！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030200",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "阴角阳角什么的，我说真的根本无所谓啦。/n要我看，还是电姬的大家更夸张，完全是另一个Level，Respect。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030210",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 202,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "资深团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那你倒说说为什么呀？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "因为我又不会聊角色，也聊不了宅话题嘛。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而且大家不是还会特别热烈地聊作品解读之类的吗？　",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030231",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我就觉得，那些东西肯定会让表演更有深度，/n而且也不是努努力马上就能学会的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030240",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "新来的孩子也都理所当然地会这些。/n我明明还是前辈，有时候就觉得自己挺没用的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030250",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 201,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊——这个嘛……怎么说呢。/n与其说是学来的，不如说是天生的性质……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "资深团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……习性，吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "习性……吗。/n感觉以前好像也有人跟我说过类似的话。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030280",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "资深团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我觉得没必要太在意啦。/n对我们来说，你愿意跟大家待在一起、还玩得开心，就已经很Happy了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "年轻团员",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就是啊！　而且只要给卡米拉前辈推荐，你就真的会去看！　/n跟你待在一起也很开心，所以果然还是女神！　",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "真是这样吗……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030310",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 40303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040303034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "要",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "好啦好啦，都注意一下——。/n热身之前先说件事哦——。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403030320",
      "CharacterMotions": [
